#: main.cpp:43
msgid ""
"Kalva is A Lightweight Videorecorder Application\n"
"\n"
"Kalva uses MEncoder for tv recording and schedules Your movie or serial "
"recording via at and cron.\n"
"If You exchange the K in Kalva with C(++) it tastes good and allways makes "
"appetite for more.\n"
"\n"
"Enjoy and have lots of fun."
msgstr ""
"Kalva é unha Aplicazón para Gravazón de Vídeo\n"
"\n"
"Kalva usa MEncoder para a gravazón de TV e planifica as gravazóns dos seus "
"filmes e séries através de at e de cron.\n"
"\n"
"Divirta-se."

